<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Pruébatelas virtualmente — IGO</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Prueba virtualmente las gafas inteligentes IGO Sport Casual y Sport Mask." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./tryon.css" />
  <script type="importmap">
  {
    "imports": {
      "three": "./vendor/three/three.module.min.js",
      "three/addons/": "./vendor/three/examples/jsm/"
    }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="tryon">
    <header class="tryon__header">
      <p class="tryon__kicker" data-i18n="kicker">IGO</p>
      <h1 class="tryon__title" data-i18n="title">Pruébatelas virtualmente</h1>
      <p class="tryon__lead" data-i18n="lead">Elige un modelo y actívala cámara para ver cómo te quedan.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="tryon__models" role="tablist" aria-label="Modelos">
      <button type="button" class="model-btn is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-model="vision" id="btn-vision">
        <span class="model-btn__name">Sport Casual</span>
        <span class="model-btn__desc" data-i18n="visionDesc">Cada día. En cualquier lugar.</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="model-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-model="shield" id="btn-shield">
        <span class="model-btn__name">Sport Mask</span>
        <span class="model-btn__desc" data-i18n="shieldDesc">Rendimiento. Sin límites.</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <section class="stage-card" aria-label="Vista previa">
      <div class="stage" id="stage">
        <video id="video" class="stage__video" playsinline muted></video>
        <canvas id="overlay" class="stage__overlay"></canvas>
        <img id="still" class="stage__still" alt="" hidden />
        <div class="stage__placeholder" id="placeholder">
          <svg class="stage__icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="6" y="14" width="36" height="24" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="24" cy="26" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M16 14l3-5h10l3 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <p data-i18n="placeholder">Activa la cámara para empezar</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stage__status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tryon__actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="btn-camera" data-i18n="activateCam">Activar cámara</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" id="btn-photo" disabled data-i18n="takePhoto">Hacer foto</button>
        <label class="btn btn--ghost btn--file" id="btn-upload-label">
          <span data-i18n="uploadPhoto">Subir una foto</span>
          <input type="file" id="btn-upload" accept="image/*" capture="user" hidden />
        </label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="tryon__privacy" data-i18n="privacy">La imagen se procesa en tu dispositivo. No se envía ni se guarda.</p>
    <p class="tryon__privacy tryon__credits">Modelo 3D de Sport Casual basado en <a href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/8f7d265819284737852ab97a53707ccd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">«Wayfarer-Style Black Glasses»</a> de islem-rd, con licencia <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>. Modificado por IGO.</p>
  </main>

  <script type="module" src="./tryon.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
